<title>NETHERLANDS: Van Leer acquires Thai packaging firm.</title>
<headline>Van Leer acquires Thai packaging firm.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch packaging group Van Leer NV said  on Friday it had acquired Uniflex Packaging Company Ltd, a Thai producer  of printed flexible consumer packaging.</p>
<p>Van Leer said the Thai company had annual sales of around 20 million  guilders and employed 150 people.</p>
<p>In future it will operate under the name Van Leer Packaging (Thailand)  Ltd. Van Leer said the acquired company would contribute to its profits  within one year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
